OL,3,ALives 'will be lost' unless UK does
OL,4,Amore to combat wildfires, committee
OL,5,Achairwoman says
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this year, one man died in a
OL,8,Fwildfire in Gloucestershire, while 19
OL,9,Fhomes were destroyed in Stourbridge,
OL,10,Fnear Birmingham, and villagers were
OL,11,Fevacuated in the Cairngorms.
OL,13,FThe government said it was investing
OL,14,Fnearly #100m to improve national
OL,15,Fresilience capabilities, which includes
OL,16,Fpiloting specially trained firefighting
OL,17,Fteams.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
